@30063 = ~making it very difficult to cast spells (50% chance of spell failure)\.~
@30064 = ~forcing the target to make a Saving Throw vs. Breath Weapon each round or suffer a 50% chance of spell failure. Creatures with Stoneskin, Fire Shield, or immunity to normal weapons are unaffected while those protections last, and undead are immune.~

@30065 = ~Spellcasting within the swarm is impossible (100% chance of spell failure)\.~
@30066 = ~Each round, creatures within the swarm must make a Saving Throw vs. Breath Weapon at -2 or be unable to cast spells (100% chance of spell failure). Creatures with Stoneskin, Fire Shield, or immunity to normal weapons are unaffected while those protections last, and undead are immune.~

@30067 = ~suffer 2 points of damage each second and a spell failure rate of 100%\.~
@30068 = ~suffer 2 points of damage each second and must make a Saving Throw vs. Breath Weapon at -2 each round or suffer a spell failure rate of 100%. Creatures with Stoneskin, Fire Shield, or immunity to normal weapons are unaffected while those protections last, and undead are immune.~

@30069 = ~die of longing for the denied illusion\. Even if the Saving Throw is successful, hapless viewers of the transformed Druid are all instantly smitten with permanent blindness (until dispelled)\.~
@30070 = ~be permanently blinded (and slain instantly if humanoid). If the Saving Throw is successful, viewers are blinded for 3 rounds.~
